# Don & Raph, Hard Science: only a spell Bot1 casts is "the next noncreature spell you cast". After the attack Bot2 casts
# Lightning Bolt and Bot1 flashes in Venser, a creature spell, whose trigger copies the Bolt twice. The copies are spells
# on the stack but were not cast, and Venser is a creature, so Mind Stone ({2}) afterwards still costs {0} with the five
# artifacts counted (all tapped for Venser). Both copies are aimed at Bot2 (6) and the Bolt itself at Bot1 (3), and Don & Raph's attack
# gets through for 2 (Bot2 at 12).

